scenario: first_place_of_a_kind
A key used for days with no GeoIP database has no countries or ASNs. When a database is installed its first country and ASN are the baseline, not detections; the next new country is raised.

step 1  0h       app     request  198.51.100.7 openai-python/3
  nothing raised

step 2  24h      app     request  198.51.100.7 openai-python/3
  nothing raised

step 3  48h      app     request  198.51.100.7 openai-python/3
  nothing raised

step 4  72h      app     request  198.51.100.7 openai-python/3
  nothing raised

step 5  8d       app     request  198.51.100.7 US AS64500 openai-python/3
  nothing raised

step 6  9d       app     request  198.51.100.7 DE AS64500 openai-python/3
  detection #1 incident 1: new_country high
      observed new country DE
      baseline US (1 request)
      from     198.51.100.7
      network  198.51.100.0/24
      country  DE
      as       AS64500 Example Net
      client   openai-python/3
  alert: incident 1 opened, high, rules [new_country], about new_country

